{"id": "MINIGAME/JT12HANA.SBN#0001", "file": "MINIGAME/JT12HANA.SBN", "offset": 4025, "capacity": 4, "raw_hex": "25743130", "baseline_text": "%t10", "kind": "ascr", "source": "%t10", "pointer_offset": 3800, "unit": "dialogue:a00cbea9173d423c", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT12HANA.SBN#0002", "file": "MINIGAME/JT12HANA.SBN", "offset": 4030, "capacity": 18, "raw_hex": "f9a9f94af293f35cf186f469f0b8f0cff7d1", "baseline_text": "한 수 부탁드립니다…", "kind": "ascr", "source": "お手合わせ願います……", "pointer_offset": 3804, "unit": "dialogue:524debb918e80884", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT12HANA.SBN#0003", "file": "MINIGAME/JT12HANA.SBN", "offset": 5212, "capacity": 44, "raw_hex": "f0b2fa48f0bcf0d7f0b9f1d181432f2ff8dff64cf1442f2ff1acf25af8aaf64cf26bf0eff7d1f0c5f0d8f0ac", "baseline_text": "이번 시합에선，//제 패가//보너스 패예요…발그레", "kind": "ascr", "source": "この試合では、//私のパイが//ボーナスパイです……ぽっ。", "pointer_offset": 3808, "unit": "dialogue:2f956e4c4a05cf3d", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT12HANA.SBN#0004", "file": "MINIGAME/JT12HANA.SBN", "offset": 4108, "capacity": 66, "raw_hex": "f0b2fa48f1e2f0dff957f0b2f299f149f0b8f0cf81442f2ff8b2f140f0b9f1478143f15af8bdf9a9f1d5f0d2f0e72f2ff1e1fbc1f1e2f0bcf29ef0cef0b8f2618148", "baseline_text": "이번 주제는 이것입니다．//이 중에서，어느 한 세트를//맞춰 주시겠습니까？", "kind": "ascr", "source": "今回のお題はこちらです。//この中の、どれか１組を//そろえていただけますか？", "pointer_offset": 3812, "unit": "dialogue:a3dd0c824608aeef", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT12HANA.SBN#0005", "file": "MINIGAME/JT12HANA.SBN", "offset": 4183, "capacity": 28, "raw_hex": "f253f14ff7d12f2ff0dff944f5f3f0c7f8d3fa99f16ff0aff0eff7d1", "baseline_text": "저기…//제가 딜러인 것 같아요…", "kind": "ascr", "source": "あの……//私が親のようです……", "pointer_offset": 3816, "unit": "dialogue:10543c10753ad7d7", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT12HANA.SBN#0006", "file": "MINIGAME/JT12HANA.SBN", "offset": 5114, "capacity": 32, "raw_hex": "f0cff2c3f0f3f7d12f2ff0b5f0b5f144f8abf247f944f5f3f0c7f26bf0ef8144", "baseline_text": "다음은…//오오가미 씨가 딜러예요．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "次は……//大神さんが親ですね。", "pointer_offset": 3820, "unit": "dialogue:beef0691bf39e183", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT12HANA.SBN#0007", "file": "MINIGAME/JT12HANA.SBN", "offset": 4245, "capacity": 48, "raw_hex": "f0dff944f0b2f941f28af144f0ef81ac2f2ff153f192f1cef960f1fcf0dbf0c82f2ff186f0aef8f1f243f0cff0b8f7d1", "baseline_text": "제가 이긴 건가요〓//남성분께 망신을//드리게 되다니…", "kind": "ascr", "source": "私の勝ち……ですか〓//殿方に、恥を//かかせてしまうなんて……", "pointer_offset": 3824, "unit": "dialogue:61425b76501bc6c0", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT12HANA.SBN#0008", "file": "MINIGAME/JT12HANA.SBN", "offset": 4306, "capacity": 46, "raw_hex": "f1c3f1c8f1c9f0a5f8dbfa99f16ff0af81432f2ff253f8f4f14ff4ddf0ef81442f2ff7d18169f0c5f0d8f0ac816a", "baseline_text": "즐거워하신 것 같아，//저도 기뻐요．//…（발그레）", "kind": "ascr", "source": "楽しんでいただけたようで、//私も、うれしいです。//……ぽっ。", "pointer_offset": 3828, "unit": "dialogue:c7a5bace9bebf879", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT12HANA.SBN#0009", "file": "MINIGAME/JT12HANA.SBN", "offset": 4367, "capacity": 34, "raw_hex": "f0b5f0b5f144f8abf247f9d7f16ff0f0f0eff7d12f2ff7d18169f0c5f0d8f0ac816a", "baseline_text": "오오가미 씨와 같네요…//…（발그레）", "kind": "ascr", "source": "大神さんと同じですね……//……ぽっ。", "pointer_offset": 3832, "unit": "dialogue:648042596dc5284b", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT12HANA.SBN#0010", "file": "MINIGAME/JT12HANA.SBN", "offset": 4404, "capacity": 50, "raw_hex": "f0cffac3f26af0e2f1572f2ff26af1f9f9a9f2ddf0ecf0b2f0b9f0ef81442f2ff3a8f194f0a5f984f154f0c8f0f1f0eff7d1", "baseline_text": "다음 상대는//상당한 강적이에요．//응원하고 있을게요…", "kind": "ascr", "source": "次の相手は//かなり、強敵でよ。//応援していますね……", "pointer_offset": 3836, "unit": "dialogue:299bc3fdc9374b0f", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT12HANA.SBN#0011", "file": "MINIGAME/JT12HANA.SBN", "offset": 4457, "capacity": 14, "raw_hex": "f491f0a5f186f469f0b8f0cf8144", "baseline_text": "축하드립니다．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "おめでとうございます。", "pointer_offset": 3840, "unit": "dialogue:b84710c5e1d20d4f", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT12HANA.SBN#0012", "file": "MINIGAME/JT12HANA.SBN", "offset": 5147, "capacity": 54, "raw_hex": "f0b2f248f0b9f8f4f36bf36cf8b6fa57f2aff0b881432f2ff0cff8bcf9a9f248f7d12f2ff26af0e2f94bf1e2f0bcf29ef15af0ef8148", "baseline_text": "이번에도 열심히 할 테니，//다시 한 번…//상대해 주시겠어요？", "kind": "ascr", "source": "今度も、がんばりますから、//もう一度……//お相手願えませんか？", "pointer_offset": 3844, "unit": "dialogue:dec899717c560577", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT12HANA.SBN#0013", "file": "MINIGAME/JT12HANA.SBN", "offset": 4543, "capacity": 42, "raw_hex": "f0e9f0a6f0d7f0b8f0cf81442f2ff253f7d1f1a7f1a8f14bf0ef81442f2ff7d18169f0c5f0d8f0ac816a", "baseline_text": "감사합니다．//저…행복해요．//…（발그레）", "kind": "ascr", "source": "ありがとうございます。//私……幸せです。//……ぽっ。", "pointer_offset": 3848, "unit": "dialogue:9f629f0f2aaf7f8d", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT12HANA.SBN#0014", "file": "MINIGAME/JT12HANA.SBN", "offset": 4596, "capacity": 54, "raw_hex": "f0d8f27ef0cef0b8f261f7d12f2ff0d8f2ca8143f2b6f0dff261f0a4f1842f2ff14ff0cff0aef984f154f8c8f2aff0b8f261f0eff7d1", "baseline_text": "그렇습니까…//그럼，언제까지고//기다리고 있을 테니까요…", "kind": "ascr", "source": "そうですか……//では、いつまでも//お待ちしておりますから……", "pointer_offset": 3852, "unit": "dialogue:dd9c339e89983c9f", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT12HANA.SBN#0015", "file": "MINIGAME/JT12HANA.SBN", "offset": 4657, "capacity": 50, "raw_hex": "f0dff944f0b2f141f7d1f28af144f0ef81ac2f2ff153f192f1cef960f1fcf0dbf0c82f2ff186f0aef984f263f0cff0b8f7d1", "baseline_text": "제가 이긴…건가요〓//남성분께 망신을//드리고 말다니…", "kind": "ascr", "source": "私の勝ち……ですか〓//殿方に、恥を//かかせてしまうなんて……", "pointer_offset": 3856, "unit": "dialogue:61425b76501bc6c0", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT12HANA.SBN#0016", "file": "MINIGAME/JT12HANA.SBN", "offset": 4718, "capacity": 46, "raw_hex": "f1c3f1c8f1c9f0a5f8dbfa99f16ff0af81432f2ff253f8f4f14ff4ddf0ef81442f2ff7d18169f0c5f0d8f0ac816a", "baseline_text": "즐거워하신 것 같아，//저도 기뻐요．//…（발그레）", "kind": "ascr", "source": "楽しんでいただけたようで、//私も、うれしいです。//……ぽっ。", "pointer_offset": 3860, "unit": "dialogue:c7a5bace9bebf879", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
